== a_grid_too_large_for_the_page
error[Z0401]: a page of 50 by 50 mm is too small for the 6 panels of this plot: however they are laid, it leaves each 14 by 7.7 mm
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:58
  |
3 | export(p.facet(rows: site, cols: arm), "grid.svg", size: [50, 50])
  |                                                          ^^^^^^^^ too many panels for the page
  |
  = help: a panel needs 12.7 mm each way; give a larger `size:`, as `two_column` (183 by 110 mm) or a width and a height in millimetres, or part the plot by a variable with fewer values

== free_scales_in_fixed_coordinates
error[Z0401]: panels with axes of their own are not drawn in `fixed` coordinates, where the scales of the plot give every panel one shape
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:40
  |
3 | p.coord(fixed).facet(by: site, scales: free_y)
  |                                        ^^^^^^ free scales, where the scales shape the panel
  |
  = help: leave `scales:` at `fixed`, or draw the plot in `cartesian` or flipped coordinates

== fixed_coordinates_after_free_scales
error[Z0401]: panels with axes of their own are not drawn in `fixed` coordinates, where the scales of the plot give every panel one shape
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:39
  |
3 | p.facet(by: site, scales: free).coord(fixed, ratio: 2)
  |                                       ^^^^^ free scales, where the scales shape the panel
  |
  = help: leave `scales:` at `fixed`, or draw the plot in `cartesian` or flipped coordinates

== free_scales_in_polar_coordinates
error[Z0401]: panels with axes of their own are not drawn in `polar` coordinates, where the scales of the plot give every panel one shape
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:42
  |
3 | p.coord(polar).facet(rows: site, scales: free_x)
  |                                          ^^^^^^ free scales, where the scales shape the panel
  |
  = help: leave `scales:` at `fixed`, or draw the plot in `cartesian` or flipped coordinates

== scales_in_quotation_marks
error[Z0403]: expected one of fixed, free, free_x, free_y, found text
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:27
  |
3 | p.facet(by: site, scales: "free")
  |                           ^^^^^^ a word, not a string
  |
  = help: write the word without quotes: `free`

== scales_that_are_none
error[Z0402]: `loose` is not one of the allowed words
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:27
  |
3 | p.facet(by: site, scales: loose)
  |                           ^^^^^ expected one of fixed, free, free_x, free_y

== too_many_panels_for_the_page
error[Z0401]: a page of 40 by 40 mm is too small for the 6 panels of this plot: however they are laid, it leaves each 6.1 by 6.3 mm
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:98
  |
3 | export(d.plot(x: week, y: count).points().facet(by: [site, arm, week, count]), "many.svg", size: [40, 40])
  |                                                                                                  ^^^^^^^^ too many panels for the page
  |
  = help: a panel needs 12.7 mm each way; give a larger `size:`, as `two_column` (183 by 110 mm) or a width and a height in millimetres, or part the plot by a variable with fewer values
